From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Generate a real door image, and stop the generic provider failure

Generate in the door editor now returns a photorealistic image of the door,
not only a description of it.

Root causes this patch fixes:

1. GPT: the request sent max_completion_tokens to a chat-completions model,
   which OpenAI answers with 400 Unsupported parameter. The field is now chosen
   from the model id (max_tokens for chat models, max_completion_tokens for
   the o1/o3/o4/gpt-5 reasoning families).

2. Claude: the default model id claude-sonnet-4-5 is retired, so Anthropic
   answered 404 not_found_error. The default is now claude-sonnet-4-6, and it
   stays overridable with ANTHROPIC_DOOR_DESCRIPTION_MODEL.

3. Both columns swallowed the provider error entirely: a failed call returned
   one generic sentence and logged nothing, so the only visible clue was
   'could not be generated'. Each failure is now logged with the provider,
   status, model id and (redacted) provider body.

4. No column could ever return a picture. Nothing in either provider call
   asked for one, and the tile under a generated description was a local
   vector sketch of the library profile badged 'Library default'.

What Generate does now:

   GPT     GPT writes the description, OpenAI images edits the door photo
           (POST /v1/images/edits) so the result keeps the real door.
   Gemini  Gemini writes the description, Gemini images draws the door.
   Claude  Claude writes the description; Google's image model draws it,
           because Anthropic's Messages API returns text only.

The image is stored under door-style-images/ai-generated/ and served by the
storage proxy. The description is still returned, so a failed drawing keeps
what the model read from the door and says why the picture is missing.

Keys are unchanged and stay server-side. New optional variables, no values
required: OPENAI_DOOR_IMAGE_MODEL (default gpt-image-2) and the existing
GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL (default gemini-3.1-flash-image).

Tests: server/lib/aiDoorImage.test.ts (13), server/lib/aiDoorDescribe.test.ts
(25), server/lib/aiDoorDescribe.wiring.test.ts (7). tsc --noEmit clean in
these files.

